All Themyscira GSM codec libraries (currently libgsmefr, libgsmfr2 and libtwamr)
use Semantic Versioning, as described at <https://semver.org/>.  In the present
source release package, the semantic versions of the included libraries are as
follows:

libgsmefr version 1.1.0
libgsmfr2 version 2.0.0
libtwamr  version 1.0.0
